                ],
                "once": true,
                "text": "\"Captain says if anybody comes up the road to count roofs, I'm to let them through and write down that they came,\" the guard says. \"That's the whole order. I asked.\"",
                "choices": [
                    {
                        "label": "Leave them to it.",
                        "end": true
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "flag": "meeting_fate",
                        "equals": "minuted"
                    }
                ],
                "once": true,
                "text": "\"Minuted, is it.\" The guard shrugs. \"We write down who comes through this gate. Not much use either, but you'd miss it if it stopped.\"",
                "choices": [
                    {
                        "label": "Leave them to it.",
                        "end": true
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "flag": "meeting_fate",
                        "equals": "subscribed"
                    }
                ],
                "once": true,
                "text": "\"Hear you own a piece of the people buying us.\" The guard does not stand any straighter. \"I'll still want to see your face at the gate.\"",
                "choices": [
                    {
                        "label": "Leave them to it.",
                        "end": true
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "flag": "meeting_fate",
                        "equals": "walked"
                    }
                ],
                "once": true,
                "text": "\"Walked out on them, I heard.\" The guard looks down the road. \"Wonder if they'll come up here now, instead.\"",
                "choices": [
                    {
                        "label": "Leave them to it.",
                        "end": true
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "text": "Road's been quiet since the wilds opened up. Too quiet, the captain says.",
                "choices": [
